<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Weatherford, BJ cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Weatherford, BJ cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley said it lowered its recommendation on both BJ Services Co and Weatherford Enterra Inc to neutral from outperformer.</p>
<p>-- In early New York Stock Exchange trade, BJ shed 1-3/8 to 36-5/8 and Weatherford shed 7/8 to 27-1/8.</p>
</text>
